@page
@model PrivacyModel
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy";
}
<h1>@ViewData["Title"]</h1>

<p>
    When you check in we store your name, and optionally your phone number, date of birth
    and reason for visit. This is only used by the front desk to manage today's queue and
    to recognise you next time you visit.
</p>
<p>
    The status page only shows your ticket number and place in the queue &mdash; it never
    shows your name. Keep your code to yourself if you don't want others to see your place.
</p>
<p>
    The waiting room board shows ticket numbers only.
</p>
<p>Questions? Please ask at the front desk.</p>
